(in-ns 'go.arbace.py) ^{:go/comments [[11 1 "// The builtins module's functions (Python/bltinmodule.c; PY5e). This file holds the functions on the"] [12 1 "// built-in types and the abstract API; the iterator types (enumerate, zip, map, filter, reversed,"] [13 1 "// callable_iterator) are builtins_iter.go's, exec/eval/compile builtins_exec.go's, __import__"] [14 1 "// import.go's. What depends on the data model's special methods of classes (format, dir's __dir__,"] [15 1 "// isinstance's __instancecheck__ ...) uses PY5c's slots and lookups when they exist."] [152 1 "// exactArgs checks a builtin's call has n positional arguments and no keywords."] [236 1 "// asciiEscape is ascii()'s escaping of a repr: every non-ASCII code point as \\x, \\u or \\U."] [278 1 "// minMax is min() and max() (min_max): the items of one iterable or of the arguments, by key, the"] [279 1 "// first extreme kept; default for an empty iterable."] [441 43 "// a lone surrogate kept (PY6c)"] [449 11 "// bytes and bytearray of one byte too (builtin_ord; PY6c)"] [463 18 "// a lone surrogate one code point (PY6c)"] [474 2 "// any int, not only a C ssize_t (REQUEST of PY6g for PY6-core: test_math's msum takes bin of a 2000-bit int)"] [527 2 "// PyNumber_Power's ternary_op (PY7: the built-in did ints by int64 and an object only by its __pow__, never the"] [528 2 "// exponent's __rpow__ nor a big int)"] [582 1 "// attrName is getattr's, setattr's, hasattr's and delattr's name: a str, or a str subclass's instance as its str"] [583 1 "// value (queue 203: CPython takes any str; test_dict's test_instance_dict_getattr_str_subclass)."] [637 3 "// a generator's StopIteration carries its return value (PY7: next() raised a bare StopIteration, the slot's"] [638 3 "// Next ending with nil)"] [657 1 "// sortObjects sorts items in place by key (nil: the items) and reverse, stably: the keys computed in"] [658 1 "// order, then PY5b's SortObjects (list.sort's)."] [711 1 "// noFrameGlobals is the globals of a call with no Python frame: the running __main__'s"] [712 1 "// (_PyEval_GetGlobalsFromRunningMain), else a new dict."] [723 1 "// frameLocals is locals() of a frame (PEP 667): a module's or class's namespace (its mapping when that is no dict;"] [724 1 "// frameNamespace), else a new dict of a function's bound fast locals, cells and free variables, then its extra locals (the proxy's"] [725 1 "// snapshot, _PyEval_GetFrameLocals: a write to it does not reach the frame)."] [728 27 "// a call with no Python frame (an interpreter's call, queue 230)"] [760 1 "// builtinDir is dir(): the scope's names, or an object's __dir__() sorted (PY5c's lookup); without a"] [761 1 "// __dir__, a module's namespace, a type's and its bases', an object's type's and its __dict__'s."] [784 3 "// the object's __dir__ (object's, type's, module's, a class's own: PY5c's), its result sorted"] [800 3 "// the scope's names: a mapping not a dict (exec's locals; queue 219) by its keys"] [901 1 "// roundFloat is float.__round__ (Objects/floatobject.c's double_round): to an int, ties to even, without"] [902 1 "// ndigits; else the correctly rounded value at ndigits decimal places (round-half-even on the exact decimal"] [903 1 "// value, as dtoa's mode 3), negative ndigits rounding to tens, hundreds ..."] [925 2 "// the exact decimal value of x, rounded half-even at n places after the point"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[20 48] [26 49] [36 47] [54 46] [60 48] [70 52] [85 41] [95 38] [104 41] [117 41] [133 52] [136 32] [142 51] [174 31] [213 59] [217 32] [228 35] [255 46] [259 22] [269 28] [272 43] [302 34] [322 44] [377 45] [400 43] [414 43] [428 46] [445 46] [453 43] [471 45] [479 23] [493 39] [500 49] [503 50] [509 37] [538 25] [554 20] [554 28] [566 32] [593 40] [596 43] [611 37] [614 40] [627 37] [630 40] [636 34] [705 44] [716 54] [730 28] [738 37] [741 40] [747 31] [763 36] [766 39] [776 24] [785 54] [793 44] [802 25] [811 29] [826 47] [827 27] [845 38] [848 41] [858 44] [862 33] 